# LSan runtime suppressions for known-benign issues in third-party code
# (not KDDockWidgets). Used via LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=<this file>.

# fontconfig builds a process-lifetime cache of font-family aliases the first
# time Qt Quick Controls' Material style initializes its theme. The cache is
# intentionally kept alive for the life of the process, not actually leaked.
leak:QFontconfigDatabase::resolveFontFamilyAlias
